 cases.  Each line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229616,"global_rank":113677,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19672},{"name":"ryanvle/theSlicks","owner":"ryanvle","html_url":"https://github.com/ryanvle/theSlicks","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229613,"global_rank":113691,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19673},{"name":"averyfreeman/django_cityloc_pkg_averyfreeman","owner":"averyfreeman","html_url":"https://github.com/averyfreeman/django_cityloc_pkg_averyfreeman","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Packaging PyPi packages using Github Actions","topics":[],"score":229613,"global_rank":113706,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19674},{"name":"kinkeadian25/bookbot","owner":"kinkeadian25","html_url":"https://github.com/kinkeadian25/bookbot","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229613,"global_rank":113711,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19675},{"name":"rishabhsinha17/BUFN403_Capstone_Project_Dashboard","owner":"rishabhsinha17","html_url":"https://